  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: settings moved from optional parameters to options objects. Pass a VcdiffEncodeOptions (CompressionLevel, MemoryMode, Optimize) to Vcdiff.Encode and a VcdiffDecodeOptions (MaxOutputBytes, MaxWindowBytes, MaxEncodedWindowBytes, Armor) to Vcdiff.Decode. LzmaVcdiff.Decode takes an LzmaDecodeOptions, which adds MaxExpandedSectionBytes and MaxDictionaryBytes. DecodeWithLimits and DecodeWithSecondaryLimits are removed. Patch bytes are unchanged.",
